====================================================================================================
  [PASS] C1 secular growth needs N = S_dS/(32 pi) e-folds to reach eps_tot = 1/(32 pi), i.e. OF ORDER S_dS (the growth IS the right order per ~S_dS e-folds -- the mechanism is not absurd)
